{title: Chala Jaata Hoon}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Rd R D Burman}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E] [A],        Chala jata hun, kisi ki dhun mein
[B] [E],        dhadakte dil ke, tarane liye
[A] [E],        milan ki masti, bhari aankhon mein
[A] [B] [E],        hazaro sapne suhane liye Chala jata hu
[E],        ye masti ke, nazaren hain,
[B],        to aise mein
[A] [B] [E],        sambhalna kaisa meri qasam
[E],        tu laharati Dagariya ho,
[B],        to phir kyu na
[A] [B] [E],        chalon main bahaka bahaka re
[A] [E],        mere jivan mein, ye shaam ayi hai
[A] [B] [E],        mohabat wale zamane liye Chala jata hu
[E],        vo aalam bhi, ajab hoga,
[B],        vo jab mere
[A] [B] [E],        karib aegi meri qasam
[E],        kabhi bayein chuda legi,
[B],        kabhi hansake
[A] [B] [E],        gale se lag jaegi hay
[A] [E],        meri bahon mein, machal jaaegi
[A] [B] [E],        vo sache zute bahane liye Chala jata hu
[E],        baharon mein, nazaron mein,
[B],        nazar Daalon
[A] [B] [E],        to aisa laage meri qasam
[E],        vo nainon mein, bhare kajal,
[B],        ghungat khole
[A] [B] [E],        khadi hain mere aage re
[A] [E],        sharam se bozl zuki palko me
[A] [B] [E],        jawan rato ke fasane liye Chala jata hu
